<title>USA: Fannie Mae adds $165 mln to REMIC 1997-22.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae adds $165 mln to REMIC 1997-22.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fannie Mae said it increased by $165 million a previously issued series of Real Estate Mortgage Investment Conduit (REMIC) securities.</p>
<p>REMIC trust 1997-22 now totals $540 million, up from $375 million, Fannie Mae said. It is backed by 30-year, 8.0-percent mortgage certificates and various FNMA REMIC tranches, the agency said.</p>
<p>It has a settlement date of March 27 and was issued via Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
